  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin (see ingredients) into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with Asian BBQ seasoning and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f971713d196bd6e0417/step-fe66ff00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice red radish and cucumber.\n• Roughly chop capsicum and plant-based kimchi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f971713d196bd6e0417/step-30421b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine gourmet leaf mix, plant-based kimchi, cucumber, capsicum, radish, garlic aioli and sesame oil blend (see ingredients). Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f971713d196bd6e0417/step-aa374e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide ‘kimchi’ salad between bowls.\n• Top with Asian BBQ roast pumpkin and crunchy fried noodles to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9f971713d196bd6e0417/step-5777c630.jpg"
    }
  ]
